===Etymology===
{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:driven|tree=1}}
From {{der|en|enm|dryven}}, from {{der|en|ang|drīfan||to drive, force, move}}, from {{der|en|gmw-pro|*drīban}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*drībaną||to drive}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dʰreybʰ-||to drive, push}}.

{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|drive||to drive}}, {{cog|yol|dhreeve}}, {{m|yol|dhrive}}, {{m|yol|dreeve}}, {{m|yol|drieve}}, {{m|yol|drive||to drive}}, {{cog|frr|driiv}}, {{m|frr|driiw}}, {{m|frr|driwe||to drive}}, {{cog|fy|driuwe||to drive; to float}}, {{cog|gsw|triibe||to drive}}, {{cog|nl|drijven||to drive, push}}, {{cog|de|treiben||to drive, push, propel}}, {{cog|nds|drieven||to drive, drift, push}}, {{cog|lb|dreiwen||to drive, propel}}, {{cog|yi|טרײַבן||to drive}}, {{cog|da|-}}, {{cog|nb|drive||to drive, propel}}, {{cog|is|drífa||to drive}}, {{cog|nn|driva}}, {{m|nn|drive||to drive, move; to propel; to run}}, {{cog|sv|driva||to drive, compel; to drift; to run}}, {{cog|got|𐌳𐍂𐌴𐌹𐌱𐌰𐌽||to drive}}.
{{col-bottom}}

